---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 38
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler
    participant Health as Model-health API and service
    participant Models as Model registry and reference
    participant DB as Persistence
    participant Live as WebSocket manager
    actor Analyst as Administrator / analyst
    participant UI as Model-health view

    loop each interval and monitoring window
        Scheduler->>Health: Evaluate observed cohorts
        Health->>Models: Resolve route and verified reference
        Models-->>Health: Compatibility and reference evidence
        Health->>DB: Load bounded cohort observations
        DB-->>Health: Inputs, outputs, and reviewed feedback
        Health->>Health: Compute quality and drift evidence
        Health->>DB: Commit shadow-mode snapshot
        opt status changed
            Health-)Live: model_health.updated
        end
    end

    Analyst->>UI: Open model-health view
    par latest snapshot
        UI->>Health: Request selected cohort and window
        Health->>DB: Read latest snapshot
        DB-->>Health: Snapshot or none
        Health-->>UI: Snapshot or 404
    and bounded history
        UI->>Health: Request recent history
        Health->>DB: Read matching snapshots
        DB-->>Health: Bounded history
        Health-->>UI: History response
    end
